<title>HONG KONG: Hwa Kay Thai interim profit down 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Hwa Kay Thai interim profit down 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.2	  vs 5.3 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.36 loss vs 74.44 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    22.07	vs 52.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		     400.62     vs 387.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hwa Kay Thai Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hwa Kay Thai distributes and markets Puma brand products and operates restaurants.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represents closure cost of a restaurant and shortfall of minumum royalties. Shares earnings adjusted for a bonus issue made in October 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852 ) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
